    family-names: Dante
    alias: 0x44 DANTE
    affiliation: 0x44 Zero Systems
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0002-5359-778X
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-09-01
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/0x44-Dante/The-Ladder
keywords:
  - hash function
  - finalizer
  - mixer
  - pseudorandom number generator
  - randomness testing
  - PractRand
  - reproducible measurement
references:
  - type: software
    title: PractRand
    authors:
      - name: Chris Doty-Humphrey
    notes: >-
      Version 0.94, the judge in every run. Built with -std=gnu++14 and
      the documented return patch; see rrc/PRACTRAND_FINDING.md.
  - type: generic
    title: >-
      Rotate, reverse and complement disguises for counter streams (the
      RRC scheme)
    authors:
      - name: Pelle Evensen
    url: https://mostlymangling.blogspot.com/
    notes: >-
      The test scheme this ladder is built on, and the source of both
      calibration weights: mix13's published failure range and NASAM's
      pass at RRC-64-42.
